# App.html Full Specification

## Design Tokens Reference
Use these exact CSS custom property names (defined in css/tokens.css):
- --color-bg: #FAFAFA, --color-bg-alt: #F5F5F7, --color-bg-elevated: #FFFFFF
- --color-fg: #1A1A2E, --color-fg-secondary: #6B7280, --color-fg-muted: #9CA3AF, --color-fg-inverse: #FFFFFF
- --color-border: #E5E7EB, --color-border-light: #F3F4F6
- --color-primary: #4F46E5, --color-primary-hover: #4338CA, --color-primary-light: #EEF2FF
- --color-ai: #6366F1, --color-ai-light: #EEF2FF, --color-ai-glow: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.12)
- --color-success: #059669, --color-warning: #D97706, --color-destructive: #DC2626
- Font: --font-sans: 'Inter', ...
- Sizes: --text-xs(0.75rem) through --text-6xl(3.75rem)
- Spacing: --space-1(4px) through --space-32
- Radii: --radius-sm(6px) through --radius-full
- Shadows: --shadow-xs through --shadow-xl (very subtle)

## HTML Document Setup
- DOCTYPE html, lang="en", proper meta tags
- Title: "FUSIQ AI"
- Link CSS files in order: css/tokens.css, css/base.css, css/components.css, css/animations.css, css/app.css, css/responsive.css
- Google Fonts: Inter weights 400,500,600,700
- Scripts (defer): js/animations.js, js/search.js, js/app.js
- Use inline SVGs for all icons (24px viewBox, stroke-width 1.5-2, stroke-linecap round, stroke-linejoin round, fill none, stroke currentColor)

