## Main Content: `<main id="app-main">`

All views are `<section>` elements with class "view". Only one has class "active" at a time.

### VIEW: HOME (`#view-home`)
```
<section id="view-home" class="view active">
```
Contains:
1. **Home Hero** (.home-hero): centered, max-width 720px
   - .hero-label: "THE UNIVERSAL AI INTERFACE" (uppercase, letter-spacing, primary color, tiny font)
   - h1.hero-headline: "Tell us what you need."
   - p.hero-subtitle: "Search across services, compare your options, and make better decisions — all from one place."
   
2. **AI Search Bar** (#search-container):
   - form#search-form.search-bar containing:
     - input#ai-search-input.search-input with placeholder "Try: Find a laptop under ₹70,000 for AI development..."
     - .search-actions with 3 buttons:
       - #voice-btn (mic SVG) 
       - #image-btn (image SVG)
       - #search-btn.search-submit-btn (arrow-right SVG, primary bg color)

3. **Suggested Searches** (.suggested-searches):
   - 4 buttons with class .suggestion-chip and data-query attributes:
     - "Find an AI internship" (data-query="Find an AI internship in Bangalore")
     - "Plan my trip" (data-query="Plan a 3-day trip to Goa under ₹15,000")
     - "Find a laptop" (data-query="Find a laptop under ₹70,000 for AI development")
     - "Find dinner nearby" (data-query="Find dinner nearby with good reviews under ₹500")

4. **Quick Categories** (.home-categories.container):
   - h2.section-label: "Explore by category"
   - .quick-categories-grid with 6 category buttons:
     - Shopping (bag SVG), Jobs (briefcase SVG), Travel (globe SVG), Food (coffee SVG), Transport (truck SVG), Healthcare (activity SVG)
   - Each: button.quick-category with data-category, containing .quick-category-icon > SVG + span with name

5. **Connected Services** (.home-providers.container):
   - h2.section-label: "Connected services"
   - p.section-sublabel: "Searching across 100+ providers to find you the best options"
   - .providers-ticker: scrolling row of .provider-pill elements:
     - Amazon, Flipkart, Swiggy, Zomato, MakeMyTrip, LinkedIn, Uber, Practo, UrbanClap, Internshala, Booking.com, Croma
     - Duplicate the first 6 for seamless scroll animation

